      "en": "His tail drew one third of the stars of the sky, and threw them to the earth. The dragon stood before the woman who was about to give birth, so that when she gave birth he might devour her child.",
      "ko": "그 꼬리가 하늘 별 삼분의 일을 끌어다가 땅에 던지더라 용이 해산하려는 여자 앞에서 그가 해산하면 그 아이를 삼키고자 하더니",
      "source_text_hash": "cc9a250093acd7984ba4579902fb080c34904516a06e2acad14e671dba3381be",
      "translation_text_hash": "602438fd74c1f1629168d7c3643108d368c474f26ce3e2be2d8e6f79d4d35650",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
